me><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Nuclear transcription factors: a new approach to enhancing cellular responses to ALA-mediated photodynamic therapy</article-title><source>Optical Methods for Tumor Treatment and Detection: Mechanisms and Techniques in Photodynamic Therapy XV</source><year>2006</year><publisher-name>San Jose, CA, Bellingham, WA: SPIE</publisher-name><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>10</lpage>Kessel D (ed) Vol. 6139, ppProceedings of the SPIE</citation></ref><ref id="bib24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ortel</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Brissette</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Dotto</surname><given-names>GP</given-names></name><name><surname>Maytin</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasan</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differentiation-specific increase in ALA-induced protoporphyrin IX accumulation in primary mouse keratinocytes</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1998</year><volume>77</volume><fpage>1744</fpage><lpage>1751</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||77|1744||bib24|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9667642</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ortel</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Sharlin</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Donnell</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Sinha</surname><given-names>AK</given-names></name><name><surname>Maytin</surname><given-names>EV</given-names></name><name><surname>Hasan</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differentiation enhances aminolevulinic acid-dependent photodynamic treatment of LNCaP prostate cancer cells</arti